    "description": "Decorative Stone Egg Lot - 7 Pieces\nPolished Marble, Onyx, Calcite, and Mineral Specimens\nIncludes 2 Ornate Metal Display Stands\nA distinctive collection of seven carved and polished natural stone eggs featuring varied mineral compositions, banded patterns, and rich colorations. Polished hardstone eggs have long been collected as tactile curios and decorative accents, showcasing the natural geological beauty of stones such as onyx, marble, and quartz. Each piece exhibits smooth contours and an all-around gloss polish.\nItems Included:\nBanded onyx/calcite egg with cream and tan strata\nWhite and grey veined marble egg on stand\nCobalt blue quartz/mineral egg on stand\nPolished red jasper/marble egg\nBright yellow calcite/alabaster egg\nSwirled grey and white marble egg\nPetite purple lepidolite/fluorite egg\nTwo ornate gold-tone metal tripod display stands\nCondition:\nAll eggs remain in good condition with smooth, lustrous finishes. Minor natural mineral pits and internal fissures characteristic of authentic stone lapidary specimens. Both metal tripod stands are structurally sound and stable with light age-appropriate patina.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
